### Quote lifecycle walkthrough for the VS Code "REST Client" extension.
### 1) Set "api" and "token" in .vscode/settings.json (rest-client.environmentVariables.dev)
### 2) Select the environment: Ctrl/Cmd+Alt+E -> dev
### 3) Click "Send Request" above each block, top to bottom.

@quoteId = PASTE_QUOTE_ID

### Create a quote (SalesRep). Leave out "employees" to let the agent estimate.
POST {{api}}/quotes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-001

{
  "clientName": "Acme Logistics GmbH",
  "country": "DE",
  "sites": 2,
  "termMonths": 24,
  "discountPct": 5,
  "language": "en",
  "customerEmail": "buyer@example.com",
  "industry": "logistics",
  "website": "acme-logistics.example"
}

### Poll the quote (status, current version, presigned PDF, allowed actions)
GET {{api}}/quotes/{{quoteId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List quotes by status
GET {{api}}/quotes?status=NEEDS_REVIEW
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### NEEDS_REVIEW -> confirm headcount (re-prices, new version)
POST {{api}}/quotes/{{quoteId}}/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "employees": 140 }

### Revise (works from DRAFT, PENDING_APPROVAL, APPROVED, SENT, VIEWED, FAILED)
POST {{api}}/quotes/{{quoteId}}/revise
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "termMonths": 36, "discountPct": 12, "skus": ["MGD-001", "SEC-001", "HLP-PRM", "BKP-001", "ONB-001"] }

### Approve (Manager for <=20% discount / <=150k net, otherwise Finance). Use a Manager token.
POST {{api}}/quotes/{{quoteId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "comment": "OK for strategic account" }

### Request changes instead of approving
POST {{api}}/quotes/{{quoteId}}/request-changes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "comment": "Max 10% discount please" }

### Send to the customer (emails the signed link, schedules reminders + expiry)
POST {{api}}/quotes/{{quoteId}}/send
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerEmail": "buyer@example.com" }

### Open "customerLink" from the response in a browser to view / accept / decline.

### Rep records a rejection received by phone
POST {{api}}/quotes/{{quoteId}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reasonCode": "price", "note": "Went with cheaper offer" }

### After ACCEPTED: record the real headcount (feeds the estimator)
POST {{api}}/quotes/{{quoteId}}/actual-headcount
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "employees": 152 }

### Audit trail
GET {{api}}/quotes/{{quoteId}}/audit
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cancel
POST {{api}}/quotes/{{quoteId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "note": "Duplicate" }
